    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691510/extras/c5b9d0cf5f7e596e573b5088ee3a727c.poster.avif?t=1713289606\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691510/extras/c5b9d0cf5f7e596e573b5088ee3a727c.webm?t=1713289606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691510/extras/c5b9d0cf5f7e596e573b5088ee3a727c.mp4?t=1713289606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a rhythmic odyssey in &quot;Rhythm Station,&quot; where you, a tenacious badger, find yourself imprisoned on a space station! Dash, shoot, and unleash abilities to the beat of the music to complete your escape. Failure means a return to the slammer, urging you to start the escape anew. Can you groove your way to freedom?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691510/extras/c5b9d0cf5f7e596e573b5088ee3a727c.poster.avif?t=1713289606\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691510/extras/c5b9d0cf5f7e596e573b5088ee3a727c.webm?t=1713289606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2691510/extras/c5b9d0cf5f7e596e573b5088ee3a727c.mp4?t=1713289606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on a rhythmic odyssey in &quot;Rhythm Station,&quot; where you, a tenacious badger, find yourself imprisoned on a space station! Dash, shoot, and unleash abilities to the beat of the music to complete your escape. Failure means a return to the slammer, urging you to start the escape anew. Can you groove your way to freedom?",
